{"title":"오컬트 로맨틱 코미디! [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=CXvCB/hAJq9cRcKG/8FaDhiYGH6HNZ5zSmVIZkK&filename=th3","synopsis":"오컬트 전문 블로그 '논 오컬텀'의 하나뿐인 기자 티모시는 지금…….“내가 대박 터뜨려 줄게요.”B급 호러 무비 전문 배우로 헐리우드 차세대 총아이자,각도별로 감탄이 절로 나오는 수려한 외모의 보유자이자,익명 공포 게시판에 올라온 목격담의 주인공인조나단 맥스타즈를 앞에 두고 고민하고 있었다.정말 저 미스터리한 인간의 손을 잡아도 되는 걸까?“재미없기만 해.”비밀로 무장한 (자칭) 티모시의 팬 조나단과,이성으로 무장한 현직 오컬트 전문 기자 티모시의캘리포니아, 오컬트, 로맨틱, 코미디!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":105,"change":{"type":"up","amount":189}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":92,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":89,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":88,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":139,"change":{"type":"down","amount":51}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":154,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":88,"change":{"type":"up","amount":66}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":82,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":127,"change":{"type":"down","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":159,"change":{"type":"down","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":185,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":142,"change":{"type":"up","amount":43}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":149,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":155,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":164,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":117,"change":{"type":"up","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":116,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":150,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":150,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":146,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":163,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":129,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"20